2026-10-28T23:12:54.4225245Z Try setting `http://address:port` to both HTTP_PROXY and HTTPS_PROXY instead.
2026-10-28T23:12:54.4226063Z 2. If you are using Windows, vcpkg will automatically use your Windows IE Proxy Settings set by your proxy software. See: https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg-tool/pull/77
2026-10-28T23:12:54.4227353Z The value set by your proxy might be wrong, or have same `https://` prefix issue.
2026-10-28T23:12:54.4228067Z 3. Your proxy's remote server is our of service.
2026-10-28T23:12:54.4229757Z If you believe this is not a temporary download server failure and vcpkg needs to be changed to download this file from a different location, please submit an issue to https://github.com/Microsoft/vcpkg/issues
